    "Feet read as curled/prepared grip art rather than spread grounded toes or a walking stride. This is art-internal source usefulness, not proof of anatomical contact with a branch.",
    "Distal claw endpoints and near/far depth remain partly ambiguous at normal size. Exact3+1 digit ownership and bilateral depth cannot be certified from labels, alpha or enlarged hooks alone.",
    "Old and new remain different static drawings. No ground standing source is replaced, and no moving/perching cycle follows from a90tick hold."
